@format 1
@id ui-event.43db94b2102f75cb
@title Viewer host visibility changed
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@event-ref cs|PPanels/PViewerLifetime.cs|PViewerHostAttach|pViewerFlyleafHost|IsVisibleChanged|1
@entry input
@summary Record Flyleaf host visibility and native-surface diagnostics; this event observes teardown but does not perform or complete it.
@tag is visible changed
@tag PViewer
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[input] Flyleaf host visibility changed <input>
- Receive the host visibility event installed during viewer host attachment @ owner.PViewerHostAttach
> trace

[trace] Record host state <process>
- Record panel and host visibility, command state, surface, handle, disposal, overlay, player, and renderer diagnostics when view tracing is enabled @ owner.PViewerHostRecord
> output

[output] Visibility observed <output>
= The diagnostic snapshot is recorded; logical media close and player disposal occur in the close-media workflow, and native-frame disappearance is not declared complete by this event.
